Brand signature lines
title end

paragraph start
A signature line is a short phrase that closes or opens a post and becomes recognisable through repetition. It must be short enough to say in one breath and be true to the voice traits.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Test each candidate by reading it aloud and checking that it does not copy another brand. Keep at most one line per face.
paragraph end

code start
language: text
candidate line, face, read aloud result, similar existing use found
code end

